From: OpenMandriva
Subject: [PATCH] Bug 2054387 - Qt: reclaim after dialog/idle activation races

Thunderbird account-hub Finish closes an HTML modal then opens the system
integration dialog via requestIdleCallback. On KDE/Wayland that loses the
click activation token and restacks the app behind others.

- Multi-delay reclaim retries after user input and chrome lifecycle
- Treat dialogs like popups for parent reclaim on hide
- Keep parent noted when focus moves to transient dialogs
- Extend interaction suppress window to 2s for idle dialog open

